<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your BeeBuzz Hosted plan is active again</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; }
        .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 24px; }
        .logo { display: inline-block; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; }
        .content { margin-bottom: 32px; text-align: center; }
        h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        p { color: #555555; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 14px; }
        .status-box { background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0; }
        .status-title { color: #166534; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .footer { border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-top: 24px; text-align: center; color: #888888; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #f5f5f5;"><tr><td align="center">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header"><div class="logo">BeeBuzz</div></div>
            <div class="content">
                <h1>Hosted plan is active again</h1>
                <div class="status-box">
                    <div class="status-title">The scheduled cancellation has been removed</div>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Your Hosted plan will remain active and is due to renew on {{.Date}}.</p>
                </div>
                <p><a href="{{.BillingURL}}">Manage subscription</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer"><p style="margin-top: 8px; color: #aaaaaa;">Automated message. Please do not reply.</p></div>
        </div>
    </td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
